<<<
+ .gitliteignore ignore-track.txt
+ cache.tmp wug.txt
> add cache.tmp
<<<
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===
.gitliteignore

